Task-Aware Object Selection Using FPGA-Based Two-Stage Approximation

Team Name : ChipUp
Team ID   : 188
Institution: Chennai Institute of Technology - Anna University
Authors   : Rosiny C A, Varsha S, Reshmi K

======================================================================
OVERVIEW
======================================================================

Object detection and task-relevance scoring run in software (YOLOv8),
which sends the top 5 scored candidates to this hardware stage. Our
accelerator takes those 5 values, computes the final ranking on the
FPGA, and picks the best (primary) and second-best (alternative)
candidate.

The accelerator is integrated into the VEGA SoC in place of the
organizer's example accelerator. Nothing else in the SoC is changed.

======================================================================
